            "Save any section or page from the editor: open the block\u2019s \u22ee menu and choose \u201cSave to cloud library\u201d. Insert saved designs from the Cloud library panel in the editor, on any of your sites.": [
                "Redaktorun ist\u0259nil\u0259n b\u00f6lm\u0259sini v\u0259 ya s\u0259hif\u0259sini yadda saxlay\u0131n: blokun \u22ee menyusunu a\u00e7\u0131n v\u0259 \"Bulud kitabxanas\u0131na saxla\" se\u00e7in. Redaktora bulud kitabxanas\u0131 panelind\u0259n yadda saxlan\u0131lm\u0131\u015f dizaynlar\u0131 ist\u0259nil\u0259n sayt\u0131n\u0131za daxil edin."
