            ],
            "Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.": [
                "Yaln\u0131z h\u0259min s\u0259b\u0259td\u0259ki obyektl\u0259ri oxuya, yaza v\u0259 sil\u0259 bil\u0259n giri\u015f a\u00e7ar\u0131 yarad\u0131n."
